#~ msgid "Tap any accepted friend in your Friends list to open their profile. Their profile shows whatever they have chosen to share: strength PRs, recent activity, body measurements, plans, standalone workouts, and custom exercises. Tap Add on a plan, workout, or custom exercise to add it directly to your own library. Imported plans and workouts are saved as new copies that you can edit freely without affecting the original. Imported custom exercises are added to your exercise library and available immediately when building workouts. Each section of a profile starts collapsed; tap its heading to open it."
